<title>USA: Rottlund Q4 sales revision due to error.</title>
<headline>Rottlund Q4 sales revision due to error.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rottlund Co Inc said Friday it revised its fiscal fourth quarter sales figure because of an error in the report issued to analysts and news organizations.</p>
<p>Earlier, Rottlund said sales for the quarter ended March 31 were $46.071 million, not $38.074 million as reported on June 9.</p>
<p>The other fourth quarter figures and the year-end data remains unchanged.</p>
<p>&quot;The year numbers and everything else stays the same,&quot; a spokesman for the company said.</p>
<p>&quot;It's just correcting an error.&quot;</p>
<p>Rottlund provides detached single family homes and attached townhomes and villas.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
